{"schema":"jigsaw-levels/v1","seriesTitle":"拾光物语","firstClearEnergy":30,"chapters":[{"id":"ch1","title":"奶奶的小店","albumId":"shiguang-ch1","pieces":[12,16,20,24,30,35],"lines":["这就是奶奶的店……好旧啊。","你是……这家店的猫？","回忆碎了，就把它拼回来。","爷爷想不起来早餐店开张那天了……","是爷爷！他在笑！","拾光镇还有好多回忆在等人拼。"]},{"id":"ch2","title":"早餐街","albumId":"shiguang-ch2","pieces":[16,20,24,24,28,30],"lines":["早餐店……飘到天上去了？","那天的包子什么味儿……想不起来喽。","团子，等等我！","这张菜谱……是奶奶的字！","奶奶也在！她在教福爷爷包包子。","奶奶的下一段回忆，在云上邮局。"],"story":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"第二天一早，阿福带小禾来到早餐街。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"滋啦——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，阿福带小禾来到早餐街。"}]},{"crop":[0,0.1758,0.2474,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"包子、油条、豆浆……整条街都是热气。"}]},{"crop":[0.4818,0.3906,0.1953,0.2344],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"小禾姐姐，你看天上！"}]},{"crop":[0.5729,0.0293,0.4167,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"早餐店……飘到天上去了？"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"那是福爷爷的店。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"早餐店原来的地方，只剩一块空地。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，早餐店原来的地方只剩一块空地。"}]},{"crop":[0.3516,0.1406,0.1693,0.2148],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"昨晚，我梦见开张那天了。"}]},{"crop":[0.3516,0.4199,0.2214,0.2148],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"嗅嗅……"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"蒸笼是空的，还留着一点面香。"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.2148,0.5013,0.376],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"那天的包子什么味儿……想不起来喽。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"蒸笼的热气，一级一级铺到了天上。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"呼——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，热气铺成了一级一级的台阶。"}]},{"crop":[0.4427,0.0391,0.2474,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"喵！"}]},{"crop":[0.7031,0.6836,0.1693,0.2344],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"小心呀——！"}]},{"crop":[0.1172,0.0586,0.4688,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"团子，等等我！"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"飘着的早餐店里，时间好像停住了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，飘着的早餐店里，时间好像停住了。"}]},{"crop":[0.2734,0.4395,0.4427,0.4395],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"菜谱碎成了一片片光。"}]},{"crop":[0.5339,0.332,0.2474,0.2734],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪！"}]},{"crop":[0.2474,0.0879,0.4036,0.3027],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这张菜谱……是奶奶的字！"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"把菜谱拼回来，店就能回家了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪嗒。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，最后一片拼了上去。"}]},{"crop":[0.4427,0.0586,0.1953,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"开张那天，有个扎辫子的姑娘来帮忙。"}]},{"crop":[0.625,0.0293,0.1953,0.3613],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“褶子捏够十八个，包子才会笑。”"}]},{"crop":[0.2604,0.3711,0.5078,0.3809],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"奶奶也在！她在教福爷爷包包子。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"天黑了，早餐街亮起一串灯笼。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，早餐店落回了老地方。"}]},{"crop":[0.4427,0.2441,0.2734,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"就是这个味儿！"}]},{"crop":[0.319,0.4395,0.1367,0.2441],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"啊呜！"}]},{"crop":[0.5339,0,0.4622,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"碎片们又飞起来了，飞向云上的邮局。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"奶奶的下一段回忆，在云上邮局。"}]}]}}]},{"id":"ch3","title":"云上邮局","albumId":"shiguang-ch3","pieces":[24,24,35,35,35,40],"lines":["这只纸鹤……是来接我们的？","欢迎来到云上邮局，咕。","这些信，都没能寄到。","收信人……是我？","奶奶写这封信的时候，我才五岁。","下一站，月光水族馆。"],"story":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"一大早，店门口落下一只好大的纸鹤。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"扑簌簌——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，一只纸鹤落在了店门口。"}]},{"crop":[0.1302,0.0977,0.2214,0.332],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"咦？！"}]},{"crop":[0.5143,0.2148,0.1823,0.2539],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"喵～"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"团子已经坐上去了。"}]},{"crop":[0.1953,0.4199,0.5859,0.4395],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这只纸鹤……是来接我们的？"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-01-page-f79bd25738e9.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-01-pagethumb-83e3fde24567.webp","panels":[[0.0098,0.0107,0.4648,0.9746],[0.4844,0.0117,0.2487,0.4307],[0.7428,0.0107,0.2487,0.4326],[0.4844,0.4561,0.5072,0.5293]]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"纸鹤一路往上飞，穿过了云。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，云上出现了一座邮局。"}]},{"crop":[0.5599,0,0.3385,0.3906],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"信封像鸟一样，绕着钟楼飞。"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.4688,0.2083,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"盯——"}]},{"crop":[0.2865,0.1172,0.651,0.4883],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"欢迎来到云上邮局，咕。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-02-page-2da9039816ab.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-02-pagethumb-aeb48cd9edc0.webp","panels":[[0.0085,0.0117,0.4688,0.9736],[0.4876,0.0107,0.2435,0.4326],[0.7415,0.0107,0.2507,0.4326],[0.4876,0.46,0.5046,0.5254]]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"分拣室里，信堆得比人还高。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，分拣室里堆满了旧信。"}]},{"crop":[0.4948,0.3516,0.3646,0.4883],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"扑通！"}]},{"crop":[0.5729,0,0.3125,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"有的信，等了好多好多年。"}]},{"crop":[0,0.1953,0.5208,0.3906],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这些信，都没能寄到。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-03-page-6127c2095d4c.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-03-pagethumb-b466f0a359b2.webp","panels":[[0.0104,0.0137,0.4557,0.9707],[0.4792,0.0137,0.2357,0.4385],[0.7279,0.0137,0.263,0.4385],[0.4792,0.4688,0.5111,0.5156]]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"有一封信，封口是一朵粉色的小花。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，一封信在桌上微微发光。"}]},{"crop":[0.4492,0.5078,0.2474,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"和小禾的发夹，一模一样。"}]},{"crop":[0.2474,0,0.2995,0.4492],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"地址碎掉了，咕。"}]},{"crop":[0.1953,0.127,0.5339,0.4004],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"收信人……是我？"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-04-page-29843fd48e4d.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-04-pagethumb-54400dce8074.webp","panels":[[0.0091,0.0117,0.4811,0.9688],[0.502,0.0117,0.235,0.4541],[0.7487,0.0117,0.2428,0.4541],[0.502,0.4824,0.4896,0.498]]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"把地址拼回来，信就能送到了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪嗒。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，信的地址拼好了。"}]},{"crop":[0.2148,0,0.2474,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“给长大以后的小禾。”"}]},{"crop":[0.3646,0.166,0.2995,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"那只小猫……是团子？"}]},{"crop":[0.1693,0.3906,0.5469,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"奶奶写这封信的时候，我才五岁。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-05-page-fc71831ef64c.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-05-pagethumb-a66d022e2522.webp","panels":[[0.0078,0.0976,0.4701,0.626],[0.4883,0.0107,0.2324,0.4434],[0.7311,0.0107,0.2617,0.4434],[0.4889,0.4697,0.5039,0.5156]]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"夜里的邮局，安安静静。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，小禾在阳台上读完了信。"}]},{"crop":[0.1628,0.2246,0.2474,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“小窝里最亮的那片拼图，是在海边捡到的。”"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.1465,0.2604,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"咚！"},{"kind":"say","at":"bl","text":"回信，我帮你寄，咕。"}]},{"crop":[0.625,0.459,0.375,0.2813],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"海面下，有什么在发着蓝光。"},{"kind":"say","at":"br","text":"下一站，月光水族馆。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-06-page-a9bb43d17cdb.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch3-06-pagethumb-8a454a23174d.webp","panels":[[0.0085,0.0098,0.4622,0.9766],[0.4811,0.0117,0.2467,0.4678],[0.7396,0.0117,0.252,0.4678],[0.4818,0.4951,0.5098,0.4912]]}}]},{"id":"ch4","title":"月光水族馆","albumId":"shiguang-ch4","pieces":[35,35,40,40,40,54],"lines":["水族馆……沉在海里？","团子，别怕，有泡泡呢。","慢慢说，这里好久没人来了。","这是奶奶最早的回忆。","原来，拼图小窝是从这里开始的。","奶奶，小窝我会好好守着的。"],"story":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"咕咕局长说，水族馆就在镇子下面的海边。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，小禾来到了海边。"}]},{"crop":[0.4557,0.2441,0.3646,0.4492],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"贝壳形的大门，在水下发着光。"}]},{"crop":[0.2799,0.3418,0.1693,0.2539],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"……喵？"}]},{"crop":[0.0781,0,0.6771,0.5078],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"水族馆……沉在海里？"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-01-page-dde0c9921e4f.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-01-pagethumb-c75b03a09671.webp","panels":[[0.0072,0.0098,0.4714,0.9785],[0.4902,0.0098,0.2565,0.4482],[0.7578,0.0098,0.2357,0.4473],[0.4909,0.4746,0.502,0.5137]]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"一个拼图形状的大泡泡，轻轻把她们包住了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"咕嘟咕嘟——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，泡泡带着她们往下沉。"}]},{"crop":[0.5859,0.1758,0.2734,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"小鱼们围过来看热闹。"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.1367,0.1693,0.2539],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"炸毛！"}]},{"crop":[0.026,0.0586,0.5729,0.4297],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"团子，别怕，有泡泡呢。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-02-page-a8709ebb3540.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-02-pagethumb-a838c2a2bb4d.webp","panels":[[0.0098,0.0146,0.4355,0.9707],[0.4551,0.0146,0.2539,0.4512],[0.7194,0.0146,0.2721,0.4512],[0.4557,0.4795,0.5358,0.5068]]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"水族馆里，水母像一盏盏灯。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，水族馆的走廊长长的。"}]},{"crop":[0.0521,0.0977,0.2083,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"灯都灭了，只剩水母还亮着。"}]},{"crop":[0.4167,0.1172,0.3646,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"我是看馆的慢慢……"}]},{"crop":[0.0521,0.0586,0.5859,0.459],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"慢慢说，这里好久没人来了。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-03-page-be531e6d61f8.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-03-pagethumb-2c907ec1d80c.webp","panels":[[0.0078,0.0107,0.4701,0.9775],[0.4902,0.0107,0.2168,0.4883],[0.7201,0.0107,0.2721,0.4883],[0.4896,0.5584,0.5026,0.3234]]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"大厅中间，有一个好大的贝壳。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，贝壳里飘出了好多碎片。"}]},{"crop":[0.3255,0.0879,0.4427,0.5469],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"碎片像水母一样，慢慢地漂。"}]},{"crop":[0.3906,0.4297,0.2344,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪！"}]},{"crop":[0.0651,0.0977,0.5859,0.4395],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这是奶奶最早的回忆。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-04-page-c9c9be63c8ea.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-04-pagethumb-7595c56a64be.webp","panels":[[0.0085,0.2857,0.4395,0.5852],[0.4609,0.0127,0.2669,0.4668],[0.7409,0.0127,0.2507,0.4668],[0.4609,0.4951,0.5306,0.4932]]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"最后一片，就在贝壳的最里面。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"叮——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，最早的回忆拼好了。"}]},{"crop":[0.4297,0,0.2604,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"很久以前，一个小姑娘在这里……"}]},{"crop":[0.625,0,0.3385,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"……捡到了第一片会发光的拼图。"}]},{"crop":[0.1302,0.2637,0.651,0.4883],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"原来，拼图小窝是从这里开始的。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-05-page-8153aad08ffc.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-05-pagethumb-1339513c7f1f.webp","panels":[[0.0104,0.1216,0.457,0.6085],[0.4785,0.0127,0.2253,0.4639],[0.7142,0.0127,0.276,0.4639],[0.4792,0.4902,0.5111,0.4941]]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"月亮升起来了，大家都来到了小窝。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，拼图小窝的灯全亮了。"}]},{"crop":[0.4036,0.2441,0.2734,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"小禾姐姐，包子来啦！"}]},{"crop":[0.6771,0.5078,0.3229,0.3906],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"海底的水族馆，也亮了。"}]},{"crop":[0,0.0391,0.4948,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"奶奶，小窝我会好好守着的。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"拾光镇的故事，还会继续。"}]}]},"comicPage":{"src":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-06-page-fde1bb271f66.webp","thumbSrc":"/puzzles/story-comic-ch4-06-pagethumb-77a5749cde3d.webp","panels":[[0.0091,0.0107,0.457,0.9756],[0.4785,0.1586,0.2513,0.2829],[0.7415,0.0107,0.25,0.4658],[0.4772,0.5419,0.5143,0.3309]]}}]}]}
